39500","kind":"announcement","title":"⟊⍜⊑⋏LG1 UFO LAS VEGAS☌⌰⟒⟒⌿","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:00:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033743","verified_at":"2026-10-22T21:52:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4739500-1846651706691364","game_id":"steam-4739500","kind":"announcement","title":"JOHN GLEEP is in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"HELLO HUMAN GAMBLER.Guess what? Steam Next Fest is live, and JOHN GLEEP is in it. That means we have a free demo of the game available for you to play RIGHT NOW! And playing it during Steam Next Fest means:1) More people discover our Steam page2) More people play our sweet demo3) More people wishlist our game4) JOHN GLEEP sells 1 gleepillion copiesAnd don't forget - the full game launches 11/11! We've got a sick release date announcement trailer and everything, in case you missed it:Join the off","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691364","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4739500-1846018067931298","game_id":"steam-4739500","kind":"announcement","title":"JOHN GLEEP launches NOVEMBER 11TH! Demo live TODAY!","summary":"Hey everyone! It's finally time to announce the release date for JOHN GLEEP! And what exactly is that date, you might ask?It's... November 11th! That's the day you get to step into the tiny debt-filled shoes of John Gleep and manage your chaotic intergalactic UFO casino. Here's a sweet new trailer to celebrate the news!What can you expect from the full release of JOHN GLEEP?Dozens of new gadgets and peg types!Character dialogue events & mini-games!A fully-fledged story that takes you through the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T20:02:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931298","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4739500-1838407329257546","game_id":"steam-4739500","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing JOHN GLEEP! And it’s published by offbrand games!","summary":"Are you an alien? Are you in massive debt? Do you fly a UFO and have a complicated relationship with the mother of your child? Then you might just be JOHN GLEEP, the protagonist of my next game - JOHN GLEEP! Check out the reveal trailer below!This trailer came out as part of the Secret Sauce Showcase, which is run by offbrand games. They don’t just run the showcase, though… they’re also publishing JOHN GLEEP! I’m so excited to have the support of the team at offbrand games. They’ll be helping wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T18:10:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329257546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4739500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:39Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4739500":"2026-10-26T14:05:39Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4739500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:38Z"},"4739820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:05:39Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4739500","app_id":4739500,"